WEBVTT

00:11:57.500 --> 00:12:03.101
how being mortal is the one thing in life
that you will never get to choose.

00:12:03.125 --> 00:12:07.518
How thinking that you're immortal
is a foolish idea.

00:12:07.542 --> 00:12:09.393
How the pleasures of sorrow,

00:12:09.417 --> 00:12:13.875
open public grief
can heal up a wounded soul.

00:12:14.792 --> 00:12:19.143
And how together we can conquer
our fear of death.

00:12:19.167 --> 00:12:20.601
Sounds good, eh?

00:12:20.625 --> 00:12:21.893
(Audience murmurs)

00:12:21.917 --> 00:12:23.559
But I wonder is anyone thinking

00:12:23.583 --> 00:12:25.875
it will never work in today's America.

00:12:27.417 --> 00:12:29.476
I don't know who
my next door neighbors are,

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:31.184
families are scattered,